  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management Reform Programme - PFM Reform Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reformprogram OFS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas st&#xf6;d till PFM reformprogrammet kanaliseras via en fond,         administrerad av V&#xe4;rldsbanken. Det anv&#xe4;nds f&#xf6;r ett programst&#xf6;d utan   &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkning och specifika villkor.Programmet genomf&#xf6;rs av Kambodjas  finansministerium.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sida support to the PFM reform programme is channelled through a  Multi Donor Trust fund managed by the World Bank. It is used for a    program support without earmarking and with no specific Swedish       conditions. The programme i implemented by the Ministry of Economy    and Finance in Cambodia.</narrative>
  </description>
